Subject: [PATCH] Mobile touch controls: multi-touch buttons, phone layout

- addButton: touchstart/touchend/touchcancel with per-finger tracking
- touch-action:none on buttons, bar, and game canvas
- Compact 6-col thumb layout under 760px; hide Inventory/Home/Respawn on phone
